WEBVTT

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:00.799
bir necha oy davomida,

00:18:00.799 --> 00:18:03.640
va yaqinda nashr qilinadigan kitob ustida ishlayapman,

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:07.283
va yaqinda muvaffaqiyatli ishimdan oshib tushishini

00:18:07.283 --> 00:18:09.943
kutish juda xavfli.

00:18:09.943 --> 00:18:12.866
O'zimga o'zim

00:18:12.866 --> 00:18:14.891
vahimaga tushgan paytlarda

00:18:14.891 --> 00:18:17.066
qo'rma deyman.

00:18:17.066 --> 00:18:18.432
Vahima qilma.

00:18:18.432 --> 00:18:20.415
Shunchaki ishingi qil.

00:18:20.415 --> 00:18:23.390
O'z qo'lingdan kelgancha davom etaver.

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:26.300
Agar ishing raqs tushish bo'lsa, raqs tush.

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.265
Agar ilohiy qudrat senga shu vazifani bergan bo'lsa